00:04:08.799 --> 00:04:12.720
things like that, which become very obvious very quickly.

63
00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:18.959
But having said that, in the process of developing new apps we

64
00:04:18.959 --> 00:04:21.759
would usually come across limitations of our database.

65
00:04:21.759 --> 00:04:25.440
So I'll give you an example. When we were initially building

66
00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:30.080
the sales tool, I didn't explicitly ask the AI to give me the ability

67
00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:33.520
to run cohort analysis, and later in that process, when I wanted to

68
00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:36.560
build this report, it tells me, hey, by the way, we can't do that

